# Deliberately vulnerable scanner conformance fixture targets (e.g. Cargo.lock,
# package-lock.json). Git continues to track already-committed fixture files;
# ignoring `*/target/` here instructs repo-root scanners that honour `.gitignore`
# (such as OSSF Scorecard's osv-scanner Vulnerabilities check) to skip fixture
# targets without modifying files inside any `<tool>/target/` directory (which
# would alter adapter config_digest assertions or suppress live re-recording).
#
# When adding new fixture files under `tests/fixtures/scanners/<tool>/target/`,
# stage them explicitly with `git add -f`.
*/target/
